<!--
  A viewfinder: four corner brackets and the line sweeping through them.

  Distinct from hi_qr, which draws a QR code — the thing being read. This draws the act of
  reading one, which is what the button does, and it stays legible at 26dp where a QR glyph
  collapses into a grey smudge.

  Same geometry as the rest of the set: 24dp box, 1.5 stroke, round caps and joins.
-->
